<p>no problem, i think this whole section is going to be a bit hard on you&#8230;.</p>
<p>I've not often taken the opportunity to play around with Foundation Agents when they <em>don't</em> immediately die screaming&#8230;it's kind of fun.</p>
<p>oddly, sections of both my and my wife's personalities keep seeping out in to these two&#8230;what parts those are I'll leave to the imagination. These two strike me as something of the &quot;cleaners&quot;. Not perhaps the best of the best, or the most skilled, but darn good at what they do. I hope to have them working together in the next story, just to see a little more of how they interact&#8230;</p>

